Problem: 
the folderName has space at end. And after not proper cloning --> on git status it will show all files deleted.

Solution :
1. after git clone command (normal cloning)
2. git restore --source=HEAD :/
3. git add *  ( it will not added as your new process
4. git status ( it will show all the files added but the incorrect folderNAme will not
5. then commit,  push.

**  it will not overwrite your previous commit with this. ** 

